it depends on camera angle for some reason but also on the distance to camera which as shown in the other report is broken too).\n\nI wish I could but this is way above my ability to fix something in godot, sorry. :0","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706280042/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706956057","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103711#issuecomment-2706956057","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103711","id":2706956057,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hWN8Z","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T16:59:18Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T22:47:48Z","body":"@viksl Can you try following the same steps on 4.4 dev/beta/RCs to determine when the regression started? You can download them [here](https://godotengine.org/download/archive/).","author